  "h1": "QuickBooks vs FreshBooks by Users and Clients",
  "introText": "FreshBooks costs less for most user-and-client counts in this price comparison. QuickBooks Online costs less for one user with six or more billable clients and for exactly three users with 51 or more clients. FreshBooks costs less for one user with up to five clients, two users at any client count, three users with up to 50 clients, and four to 25 users at any client count.\n\nAt ModernWallet, we modeled monthly list prices across 49 user-and-client combinations using the [QuickBooks pricing page](https://quickbooks.intuit.com/pricing/) and [FreshBooks pricing page](https://www.freshbooks.com/pricing) as inputs. Prices were checked November 16, 2026, and promotions are excluded. QuickBooks also has a $0 Free plan for one user sending up to two invoices a month.",
